Comment: md's own code is MIT (Expat). The package also carries, in
 /usr/share/md/rich, the engines that draw math, diagrams and highlighted code
 in the preview: the same files every md edition ships. For each one the
 paragraphs below say what the file itself states, and where it states
 nothing, which upstream release it is and what that release publishes. Every
 engine except plantuml.js was compared byte for byte with the npm release
 named in its paragraph and is identical to it.

