 the authors of each crate listed below
License: Expat
Comment: md is written in Rust and its binary also contains these crates from
 crates.io, compiled in: bitflags, cairo-rs, cairo-sys-rs, field-offset,
 futures-channel, futures-core, futures-executor, futures-io, futures-task,
 futures-util, gdk-pixbuf, gdk-pixbuf-sys, gdk4, gdk4-sys, gio, gio-sys, glib,
 glib-sys, gobject-sys, graphene-rs, graphene-sys, gsk4, gsk4-sys, gtk4,
 gtk4-sys, javascriptcore6, javascriptcore6-sys, libadwaita, libadwaita-sys,
 libc, memchr, memoffset, pango, pango-sys, pin-project-lite, slab, smallvec,
 soup3, soup3-sys, unicode-segmentation, webkit6, webkit6-sys. Each crate's
 manifest declares MIT, or offers MIT as one of its choices (MIT OR Apache-2.0,
 Unlicense OR MIT); this package takes the MIT option. scripts/package.sh
 refuses to build when the binary links a crate this list does not name, or
 one that does not offer MIT.

